{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A 2d puzzle-platformer with fun mechanics like picking up and placing blocks. Rescue yourself and your family after a sandstorm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras/banner_discover.png?t=1744740011\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Squinky and go through a journey. Visit 3 different areas, discovering unique puzzle-elements. <i>Can you solve all puzzles and become a hero?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras/banner_create.png?t=1744740011\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the inbuilt level editor you can make your own levels and upload them online. Other players can play your levels and you can play their levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras/story.png?t=1744740011\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565330?t=1744740011","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/95dcb66556834dd07e25c45dd1419d53771ad731/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744740011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/3512b7fda4bfe5f13a23f831d42ece77b26c51ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744740011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/3512b7fda4bfe5f13a23f831d42ece77b26c51ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744740011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A 2d puzzle-platformer with fun mechanics like picking up and placing blocks. Rescue yourself and your family after a sandstorm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras/banner_discover.png?t=1744740011\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Squinky and go through a journey. Visit 3 different areas, discovering unique puzzle-elements. <i>Can you solve all puzzles and become a hero?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras/banner_create.png?t=1744740011\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the inbuilt level editor you can make your own levels and upload them online. Other players can play your levels and you can play their levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/extras/story.png?t=1744740011\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Lobigart"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565330/71e0195d7094502a75e7b71f9bc0a266df240922/header.jpg?t=1744740011","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125231,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125231/movie480.mp4?t=1744740010","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125231/movie_max.mp4?t=1744740010"},"name":"Squinky Trailer - Whishlist Now!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125231/2ec53d99ba97dab46c53f32bb79e6311bebe17a8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744740010","webm":{"480":"http